      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"This is HUGE. Etsy is home to thousands, maybe tens of thousands, of supply sellers offering blanks like tumblers, shirts, and hats. Many of those may now be considered noncompliant.\"",
      "context_before": null,
      "context_after": null,
